    },
    "message": "Read fixture paths from support.paths in every test file\n\nAbout 60 test files built their own constants for files under fixtures/\n(FIXTURE, SMALL_SCENARIO, BASELINE_PATH ...) from Path(__file__).parents[N],\nand a few loaded relative \"fixtures/...\" paths that depended on the working\ndirectory. Each constant was matched to a support.paths name by the file it\nresolves to, its uses renamed and its definition removed; the relative and\nin-function paths now use the same constants. Paths derived for one file\n(DEMO_REPLAY / \"runs\") stay local, and two strings that repo tests compare as\ndata are unchanged.\n\nPart of #138.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
